-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Chambers</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Garcia</surname><given-names>LJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Heaton</surname><given-names>LJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Coldwell</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Psychometric properties of Spanish-language adult dental fear measures</article-title><source>BMC Oral Health</source><year>2008</year><volume>8</volume><fpage>15</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18474102</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1186/1472-6831-8-15</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kleinknecht</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>Klepac</surname><given-names>RK</given-names></name><name><surname>Alexander</surname><given-names>LD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Origins and characteristics of fear of dentistry</article-title><source>J Am Dent Assoc</source><year>1973</year><volume>86</volume><fpage>842</fpage><lpage>848</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">4511174</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Moore</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Berggren</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Carlsson</surname><given-names>SG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Reliability and clinical usefulness of psychometric measures in a self-referred population of odontophobics</article-title><source>Community Dent Oral Epidemiol</source><year>1991</year><volume>19</volume><fpage>347</fpage><lpage>351</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1684925</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1600-0528.1991.tb00185.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Johansson</surname><given-name