name>Vassiliou</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Georgas</surname><given-names>JG</given-names></name><name><surname>Vassiliou</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Variations in manifest anxiety due to sex, age, and education</article-title><source>J Pers Soc Psychol</source><year>1967</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>194</fpage><lpage>197</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6035312</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1037/h0024572</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Feingold</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Gender differences in personality: a meta-analysis</article-title><source>Psychol Bull</source><year>1994</year><volume>116</volume><fpage>429</fpage><lpage>456</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7809307</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1037/0033-2909.116.3.429</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Klingberg</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Reliability and validity of the Swedish version of the Dental Subscale of the Children's Fear Survey Schedule, CFSS-DS</article-title><source>Acta Odontol Scand</source><year>1994</year><volume>52</volume><fpage>255</fpage><lpage>256</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7985512</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.3109/00016359409029055</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B26"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>ten Berge</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Veerkamp</surname><given-names>JSJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoogstraten</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Prins</surname><given-names>PJM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Childhood dental fear in the Netherlands: prevalence and normative data</article-title><source>Community Dent Oral Epidemiol</source><year>2002</year><volume>30</volume><fpage>101</fpage><lpage>107</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12000350</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1034/j.1600-0528.2002.300203.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B27"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nakai</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Hirakawa</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Milgrom</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Coolidge</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Heima</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Mori</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Ishihara</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Yakushiji</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Yoshida</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Shimono</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The Children's Fear Survey Schedule-Dental Subscale in Japan</article-title><source>Community Dent Oral Epidemiol</source><year>2005</year><volume>33</volume><fpage>196</fpage><lpage>204</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15853842</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1600-0528.2005.00211.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B28"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Arapostathis</surname><given-names>KN</given-names></name><name><surname>Coolidge</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Emmanouil</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Kotsanos</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Reliability and validity of the Greek version of the Children's Fear Survey Schedule &#x02013; Dental Subscale</article-title><source>Int J Paediatr Dent</source><year>2008</year><volume>18</volume><fpage>374</fpage><lpage>379</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18284471</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1365-263X.2007.00894.x</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>